    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Cohesive dark technical aesthetic, disciplined cyan/red accents, strong desktop headline, consistent card styling, and responsive reflow without viewport overflow. However, tablet and especially mobile typography is excessively small and low-contrast; chart labels, explanatory copy, table metadata, and header navigation are difficult to scan. The mobile ablation table becomes visually dense, while the desktop composition leaves a large, weakly balanced gap beside the hero. These issues keep it below demo-ready polish.",
